title: "Strange Loop Lab"
abstract: "A deterministic, white-box TypeScript laboratory for self-model, metacognition and consciousness-indicator research across six opt-in generations (V0.1-V0.6), with 100-seed validators, raw per-seed artifacts and an untouched V0.6 holdout."
